{
  "format": "call-of-slop-stations/1",
  // The stations' markets (docs/sandbox/constructs/station.md "Markets"; Karl, 2026-11-18: "The first gameplay loop is being able to dock with
  // it and sell mined ores" and "as a logistics point, it should show up on the friendly market as whatever goods are there to trade").
  // A station is matched by its name (its pieces' section). "power": the NPC power that holds it (Crew/Factions, or a Powers folder): a power
  // hostile to a player doesn't trade with them. Each good: "buy", what the station pays a unit (credits); "sell", what it asks a unit; "stock",
  // what it holds at the start; "most", what it holds at most (it buys no more past that). "margin": the share of what a station pays that its
  // power counts in its stock (the trade it does on it).
  "margin": 0.25,
